6
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.140
Knowing how to use it well can help
you stand out at work, reclaim the time

7
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:23.380
admin takes from your family, and achieve
things you never thought possible.

8
00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:29.900
