using AI like an expert.

15
00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:52.460
Month One gives you a firm foundation
that the next two months then build on.

16
00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:55.820
Every lesson has a
practical element and if you

17
00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:58.880
get stuck there is a
step-by-step video and you

18
00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:01.420
can ask a question inside
the lesson and we'll

19
00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:04.520
answer within twenty-four
hours, weekends included.

20
00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:09.040
We update lessons as AI changes
and add new ones all the time,

21
00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:11.520
